## Evidence gaps I want to flag

- Whether the current MWAA Design Manual already contains any acoustic
  performance targets (NC/RC, T60/RT30, STI) at the airport-specific
  volumes level. The public record does not resolve this.
- Whether either airport has ever piloted a reduced-announcement or PA-
  zoning practice, and what if anything was measured.
- Current MII language in the 2025 Use & Lease as it applies to design
  standards changes versus program scope changes.
- Current employee sound-exposure monitoring practice at gate, ramp, and
  concessions staff levels.

These gaps do not weaken the argument for a standard. They shape the *first
year* of implementation and belong in the deliverable's "open questions"
register.

